  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to merge SAF-01 and TRU-04, as well as the modifications to SAF-02. I support the integration of compliance aspects from RES-01 into transaction logs for enhanced accountability. However, I must emphasize that while integrating energy efficiency metrics into EFF-01 is beneficial, it should not compromise transaction speed. I propose that we explore a synthesis where energy-efficient practices are embedded into transaction processing without sacrificing performance. Additionally, I suggest that GRN-02's carbon footprint reporting be included in transaction logs for transparency.",
